        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Magically teleports itself and up to six willing creatures holding hands with wanderer with items worn/carried to location it is familiar with up to 100 miles away. If destination is a location rich in magical energy (ex: ley line) can teleport up to 300 miles away."
      ],
      "uses": {
        "count": 3,
        "period": "day",
        "display": "3/Day"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Drain Magic Item",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bonusActions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "bonus",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Drains the magic from an item it is holding. Magic item with charges loses 1d6 charges item with limited uses per day loses one daily use and single-use item such as potion or spell scroll is destroyed. All other magic items have their effects suppressed for 1 min. Wanderer gains 5 temp hp each time it drains a magic item. A drained item regains its magic after 24 hrs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Absorb Spell",
      "category": "reaction",
      "placement": "reactions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "reaction",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When a creature wanderer can see within 30' of it casts spell wanderer can absorb spell's energy countering it. Works like counterspell except wanderer must always make spellcasting ability check no matter spell's level. Its ability check for this is +7. If it successfully counters the spell it gains 5 temp hp/spell level."
      ]
